Dialogue: 10,0:00:00.78,0:00:02.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tolong aku!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:02.41,0:00:04.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku ada di dalam kotak kayu ini!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:04.98,0:00:06.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tunggu, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:06.35,0:00:07.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sebentar lagi kukeluarkan!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:08.34,0:00:10.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayhan, ini berat.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:10.51,0:00:11.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak bisa sendirian.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:11.75,0:00:12.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:13.35,0:00:14.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Satu, dua...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:16.35,0:00:18.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian baik-baik saja?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.34,0:00:30.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih banyak!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.78,0:00:34.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terus-menerus dikurung di sini,\Nrasanya benar-benar menyiksa!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.22,0:00:37.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian penyelamat hidupku!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:37.95,0:00:41.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Halo. Namaku Ayhan.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.98,0:00:43.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau aku Senai.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:44.00,0:00:45.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau siapa?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:46.41,0:00:47.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.01,0:00:53.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namaku Aymer Jerrybower dari Suku\NManusia Tikus Pelompat Telinga Panjang.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:53.05,0:00:57.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Walau tubuhku begini,\Naku sudah dewasa dan seorang perempuan.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:57.24,0:00:59.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kacamatamu cocok sekali, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:59.49,0:01:03.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, ini buatan sendiri.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.00,0:01:06.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Buku belajar ini juga kubuat sendiri.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:07.01,0:01:08.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hebat!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:08.50,0:01:11.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aymer, kenapa kau bisa dikurung?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:11.58,0:01:13.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa kau sedang dihukum?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:13.55,0:01:15.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan begitu.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:15.51,0:01:18.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bisa dibilang,\Norang-orang dari sukuku sendiri
Dialogue: 10,0:01:18.34,0:01:20.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,berniat berbuat buruk kepada Tuan Dias,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:20.60,0:01:22.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,lalu aku ikut terseret.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:22.85,0:01:25.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aymer, apa kau temannya Dias?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:25.99,0:01:28.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak, bicara dengannya pun belum.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:28.60,0:01:32.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apalagi sejak datang ke sini,\Naku sama sekali tak bisa keluar.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:34.86,0:01:39.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begini, ada yang ingin\Nkami konsultasikan denganmu, Aymer.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:39.01,0:01:42.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Konsultasi rahasia yang tak boleh sampai\Nketahuan Dias dan yang lainnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:43.69,0:01:46.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Konsultasi rahasia?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.38,0:03:20.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitulah ceritanya. Kau paham?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.30,0:03:25.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu, biar kucoba luruskan dulu, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.02,0:03:25.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pertama-tama...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.72,0:03:31.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Senai dan Ayhan bagian dari\N"Suku Manusia Hutan", 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.45,0:03:32.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.45,0:03:33.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Suku Manusia Hutan.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.73,0:03:39.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Suku Manusia Hutan tinggal di hutan,\Nmelindungi hutan, lahir dari hutan.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.24,0:03:41.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa itu benar?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.15,0:03:42.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.74,0:03:45.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saat Manusia Hutan
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.74,0:03:48.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,berada di ambang kematian,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.24,0:03:52.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,mereka akan memasukkan kekuatan\Ndan pengetahuan ke benih.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.15,0:03:57.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di saat-saat terakhirnya,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.09,0:04:00.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Manusia Hutan mempercayakan\Nbenih mereka ke orang terdekat.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.55,0:04:05.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Orang yang dipercaya\Nakan menjaga dan merawat benih itu
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.09,0:04:06.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,hingga menjadi hutan.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.52,0:04:08.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pohon yang sudah tumbuh besar,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.85,0:04:10.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,dengan disentuh tangan,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.78,0:04:12.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,membuat kita merasakan\Nperasaan mendiang orang itu,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.88,0:04:15.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,keberadaannya layaknya batu nisan.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.35,0:04:17.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Keberadaannya juga layaknya buku
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.75,0:04:20.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,tempat mempelajari berbagai pengetahuan,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.21,0:04:22.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,sekaligus layaknya silsilah keluarga
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.78,0:04:25.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,tempat merasakan garis keturunan sendiri.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.87,0:04:28.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Demi melindungi pepohonan itu,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.65,0:04:33.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,ada kekuatan membagi sihir\Nuntuk mempercepat pertumbuhan tanaman,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.12,0:04:36.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan ada juga kekuatan\Nuntuk menciptakan penghalang
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.18,0:04:38.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,demi menjauhkan penyakit serta miasma,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.25,0:04:40.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,yang dimiliki Suku Manusia Hutan,\Nbegitu, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.74,0:04:41.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:42.35,0:04:43.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.38,0:04:44.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hebat, hebat!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.95,0:04:46.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aymer pintar sekali, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.95,0:04:48.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih banyak.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.38,0:04:51.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena kami masih belum dewasa,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.85,0:04:53.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,kami baru bisa menumbuhkan tunas\Ndari buah pohon,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.91,0:04:57.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan baru bisa sebatas\Nmembuat penghalang kecil saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.85,0:04:58.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.65,0:05:02.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,ini tak boleh diberitahukan kepada manusia.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.15,0:05:04.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini janji terakhir...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:04.96,0:05:07.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,dengan Ayah dan Ibu.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.25,0:05:12.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,"Jangan sampai ada yang lihat\Nsaat kami menggunakan kekuatan."
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.15,0:05:16.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,"Karena kalau sampai ketahuan manusia,\Nkekuatan ini akan disalahgunakan," katanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.25,0:05:18.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wajar saja, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.51,0:05:20.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sebab itu memang kekuatan luar biasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.45,0:05:22.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi kalau begitu,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.05,0:05:24.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,kenapa kalian tinggal\Nbersama Tuan Dias dan yang lain
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.44,0:05:26.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,yang merupakan kaum manusia?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.17,0:05:29.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena harus menepati janji,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.71,0:05:32.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,tadinya kami pikir\Nmau segera melarikan diri.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.61,0:05:33.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, ya...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.64,0:05:36.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tangannya hangat dan lembut.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.24,0:05:39.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Suaranya juga lembut.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.98,0:05:42.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rasanya seperti Ayah dan Ibu.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.19,0:05:44.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Orangnya baik...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.11,0:05:48.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Walau agak bau keringat, sih.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.21,0:05:49.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bau keringatnya lumayan menyengat, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.58,0:05:54.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terus, semua orang lain juga...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.01,0:05:57.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semuanya orangnya baik-baik.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.11,0:06:00.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Makanya kami jadi\Ningin tinggal bersama mereka.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.94,0:06:02.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dias itu mengolah ladang,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.50,0:06:06.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan tiap hari dia kerja keras sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.59,0:06:10.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi tak boleh,\Nkarena tempat ini energinya sedang terserap.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.01,0:06:13.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Agar tak terus terserap,\Nkami butuh sebuah penghalang.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.98,0:06:16.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalaupun dia sampai tahu soal kekuatan kami,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.85,0:06:19.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,kurasa Dias takkan\Nmenyalahgunakannya, tapi...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.78,0:06:22.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,karena ini sudah janji.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.77,0:06:25.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, maksud dari rahasia\Nyang ingin dikonsultasikan ini
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.21,0:06:28.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,adalah kalian mencari cara\Nuntuk pasang penghalang
Dialogue: 10,0:06:28.18,0:06:30.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,tanpa sampai ketahuan, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.75,0:06:32.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.03,0:06:36.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana kalau lakukan tengah malam\Nsaat semua orang tidur lelap?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.51,0:06:40.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tak bisa, kami juga tidur kalau malam.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.04,0:06:42.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, biar kubangunkan nanti.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:42.58,0:06:46.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Penglihatan malamku bagus,\Naku juga bisa pandu jalan di kegelapan malam.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.00,0:06:49.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Untung kita konsultasi dengannya, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.04,0:06:49.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:50.01,0:06:52.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau kalian seheboh ini,\Nnanti ketahuan, lo.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:50.01,0:06:52.80,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Hore, hore!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.84,0:06:54.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mari kita berusaha.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.98,0:06:56.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aman atau tidak, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.98,0:06:57.06,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Ayo semangat!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.61,0:07:05.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rasanya segar kembali.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:10.45,0:07:13.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagian yang tak sengaja dirusak\Noleh Senai dan Ayhan itu,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.98,0:07:15.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,yang ini, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.78,0:07:29.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tuan Dias si Pembantai Naga.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.42,0:07:32.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan sampai ketahuan, aku harus hati-hati.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:37.00,0:07:38.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hampir saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.25,0:07:42.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ternyata persis kata Senai dan Ayhan, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.53,0:07:50.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selamat malam.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.38,0:07:51.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini Aymer.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.74,0:07:53.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo bangun!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.53,0:07:58.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Waktunya ke ladang, lo.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.05,0:08:01.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau tak cepat bangun,\Nnanti keburu pagi, lo.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.18,0:08:18.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.01,0:08:20.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gelap.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.05,0:08:21.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Takut.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.07,0:08:21.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.81,0:08:25.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau malam mau ke toilet atau semacamnya,\Nbiasanya bagaimana?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.23,0:08:29.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dias atau Alna akan menemani kami pergi.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.44,0:08:32.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gawat juga, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.38,0:08:35.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sepertinya keberadaanku pun\Ntak membuat kalian tenang.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.66,0:08:36.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.58,0:08:44.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayah.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.85,0:08:46.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ibu.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.65,0:08:49.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.16,0:08:50.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.31,0:08:54.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benih yang dipercayakan itu,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.50,0:08:58.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,rupanya sedang mendorong punggung kalian\Nagar terus maju, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.44,0:09:06.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tunggu sebentar, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.66,0:09:07.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.95,0:09:25.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tegu para are shize isutan radi sen...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.97,0:09:33.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tegu para are shize isutan radi sen...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.86,0:09:38.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Duushize isutan sukuuria...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.71,0:09:42.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ifisutaradi mo zeare...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.43,0:09:47.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sungguh indahnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.43,0:09:52.69,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Hagee erusei migoe eruse negoe...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:09.98,0:10:12.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah jadi, ya, penghalangnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.35,0:10:13.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah jadi.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.96,0:10:15.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ngantuk.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:15.95,0:10:16.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Capek.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.97,0:10:18.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidur.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.65,0:10:21.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, tugasku sudah selesai, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.39,0:10:24.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anu...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.72,0:10:27.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,bisa tolong lepaskan aku?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.11,0:10:29.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau terus begini, bisa ketahuan.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.98,0:10:32.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh? Kalian malah tidur?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.41,0:10:34.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tu-Tunggu, lepaskan aku...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.51,0:10:37.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tolong lepaskan aku!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.95,0:10:50.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, kau sudah dengar?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:50.12,0:10:54.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kabar Tuan Eldan, penguasa wilayah baru,\Nakan pergi ke ibu kota.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.01,0:10:55.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah dengar, sudah dengar.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.63,0:10:59.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Katanya dia akan mempersembahkan\NBatu Sihir Earth Dragon
Dialogue: 10,0:10:59.25,0:11:02.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,yang didapat dari si Pembantai Naga\Nkepada Raja, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:02.14,0:11:06.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia pasti akan disukai dan diakui resmi\Nsebagai penguasa wilayah.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.89,0:11:11.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, Wilayah Kasdeks ini\Njuga akan makin aman dan sejahtera.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.38,0:11:13.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi aku dengar rumor...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.02,0:11:16.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Katanya si Pembantai Naga\Npunya istri seorang Setengah Manusia,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.29,0:11:19.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan saling mencintai begitu dalam\Nsampai bermesraan di depan umum.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.78,0:11:22.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu benar, tahu.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.01,0:11:25.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kakakku adalah pengawal Kamalotz.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.03,0:11:28.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seingatku si Pembantai Naga\Nberasal dari wilayah timur, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:28.85,0:11:33.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Manusia wilayah timur terkenal\Nsangat benci Setengah Manusia, kok bisa?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.05,0:11:36.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jatuh cinta pada pandangan pertama\Ndengan Setengah Manusia.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.41,0:11:38.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Katanya itulah istrinya sekarang.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:38.80,0:11:42.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selain itu,\Nkatanya dia punya tanduk juga, lo.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:42.30,0:11:44.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau punya tanduk,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.71,0:11:45.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,jangan-jangan...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.61,0:11:47.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Badak?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.56,0:11:51.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seorang manusia bisa jatuh cinta\Ndengan Suku Manusia Badak, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.01,0:11:52.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hebat banget.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.19,0:11:56.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lagi pula, untuk perekrutan\Nrakyat wilayahnya saja tak pandang suku.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.44,0:11:58.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Penjahat dan kriminal dilarang masuk.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:58.98,0:12:02.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Katanya rumah dan makanan\Nakan disediakan si Pembantai Naga.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:02.55,0:12:04.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Suku Manusia Anjing ras kecil,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:04.40,0:12:07.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,beberapa orang sampai terpaku\Nmelihat papan pengumuman itu, tahu.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:07.45,0:12:09.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bicara soal ras kecil,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.60,0:12:12.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,insiden yang disebabkan Suku\NManusia Tikus Pelompat Telinga Panjang itu,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:12.58,0:12:14.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,sepertinya ada dalang, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:14.21,0:12:15.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dalang?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.75,0:12:16.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.53,0:12:21.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kabarnya, mereka mengaku dihasut\Nsekelompok orang atas nama Manusia Kera.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:21.47,0:12:24.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukankah mereka cuma membual\Nuntuk lepas dari tanggung jawab?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.97,0:12:27.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Awalnya diduga begitu,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:27.01,0:12:31.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi kelompok yang mengaku dihasut\NSuku Manusia Kera berselubung kain hitam itu
Dialogue: 10,0:12:31.81,0:12:33.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,ternyata muncul di tempat lain juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.61,0:12:39.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sial, sial, sialan!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:42.24,0:12:45.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi tikus satu-satunya\Nyang berhasil kukelabui itu gagal, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.65,0:12:47.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Halo, Abang tampan.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:52.00,0:12:54.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mau main sebentar denganku?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:54.79,0:12:56.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Enyah kau!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.25,0:13:00.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa-apaan dia itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.80,0:13:02.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Keparat!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:02.95,0:13:04.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gara-gara dia, aku sampai...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:05.38,0:13:07.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tunggu pembalasanku, Dias.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:07.05,0:13:09.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pasti akan kubunuh kau!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.52,0:13:16.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pergantian kekuasaan di Wilayah Kasdeks, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.27,0:13:18.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagi Pangeran Kedua, Yang Mulia Meiser,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.40,0:13:20.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,ini pasti akan menyulitkan posisinya.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:20.48,0:13:21.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.28,0:13:25.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Duke Kasdeks pendahulu\Nmenguasai perdagangan wilayah barat,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.28,0:13:28.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,padahal itu yang selama ini\Nmendatangkan kekayaan bagi Yang Mulia Meiser.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:28.15,0:13:31.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kehilangan itu tentu\Nmenjadi pukulan yang sangat telak.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:31.04,0:13:34.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apalagi anak kedua bernama Eldan\Nyang mewarisi kekuasaan itu
Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.21,0:13:37.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,berniat jaga jarak dengan Yang Mulia Meiser.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.54,0:13:41.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, takhta berikutnya\Nsudah pasti jatuh ke Yang Mulia Richard, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:41.80,0:13:46.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak juga, ketiga Yang Mulia Putri Raja\Npun belum menyerah.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.25,0:13:50.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi kalau si bungsu Diane,\Nsepertinya tak punya peluang, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.55,0:13:52.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Diane...!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.51,0:13:53.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.31,0:13:56.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yang Mulia Diane pergi ke luar ibu kota\Nmemimpin pasukan
Dialogue: 10,0:13:56.15,0:13:57.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,dalam jumlah yang cukup besar!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.94,0:14:01.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu hal biasa.\NJangan ributkan hal kecil.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:01.34,0:14:04.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ta-Tapi...\NBeliau membawa hampir 200 prajurit, lo!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.91,0:14:07.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kereta kuda pengangkut pangan\Njuga ada puluhan unit.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.75,0:14:09.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa akan ada perang di suatu tempat?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:10.70,0:14:14.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biarkan saja.\NNanti pasti ada yang menanganinya.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:23.81,0:14:25.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada apa, Alna?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:26.84,0:14:28.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.34,0:14:32.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu, selamat pagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:34.35,0:14:38.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa bisa ada tikus di sini?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.10,0:14:41.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:41.77,0:14:42.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bau!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:42.95,0:14:45.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa-apaan ini, berani-beraninya\Nmembawa tikus ke tempat tidur?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.86,0:14:49.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau tubuh tak dibersihkan air\Nramuan obat, tak boleh masuk rumah!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:49.36,0:14:51.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.18,0:14:53.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena tikus bisa menjadi\Nsumber penyakit mematikan.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.87,0:14:55.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Uh, maafkan aku.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:55.87,0:14:58.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau juga, bersihkan badanmu sendiri.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:58.75,0:15:00.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baik!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:05.00,0:15:08.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian bertiga,\Nrenungkan kesalahan kalian di sini!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.63,0:15:10.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baik.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:10.01,0:15:11.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baik...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.51,0:15:13.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka tampak sangat terpukul,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.90,0:15:17.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi dimarahi sungguh-sungguh begini\Njuga pengalaman penting.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:17.77,0:15:20.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Padahal tadinya kukira dia\Nsisa anggota insiden penyerangan,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.50,0:15:23.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi hasil Penilai Jiwa Alna\Nmenunjukkan warna biru kuat, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.81,0:15:27.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nak Dias, gawat!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.05,0:15:29.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cepat kemari!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:31.78,0:15:33.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:33.03,0:15:34.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.31,0:15:36.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini masalah serius, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:36.36,0:15:37.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.54,0:15:39.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi ajaib, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.41,0:15:44.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Padahal kita membuat dua jenis tanah,\Ntapi seolah tak peduli bedanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:44.04,0:15:47.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tak disangka bisa tumbuh\Nmembentuk lingkaran bulat indah, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:47.95,0:15:50.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dias, kau berhasil!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:50.05,0:15:52.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tak disangka benar-benar bisa berakar.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:52.81,0:15:54.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini pencapaian luar biasa!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:54.55,0:15:57.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bahkan bisa dibilang keajaiban!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.34,0:15:58.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Memang benar,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:58.18,0:16:00.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,kau pria dengan kejantanan yang hebat.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.41,0:16:04.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jiwamu yang kuat dan pantang menyerah\Nakhirnya membuahkan hasil!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:04.69,0:16:07.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sungguh bahagia, Dias!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.41,0:16:11.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga bahagia, Alna.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.57,0:16:17.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tentu saja, keberhasilan ladang ini\Nhal yang menggembirakan.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.25,0:16:19.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namun...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:20.18,0:16:21.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Alna.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.33,0:16:24.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagiku, hal yang terasa\Njauh lebih membahagiakan adalah
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.83,0:16:28.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,kau bisa sebahagia ini untukku.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:38.85,0:16:43.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi kotak ini, ya, tempat Manusia Tikus\Nbernama Aymer bersembunyi.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:45.85,0:16:49.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Perkenalkan, ini pertama kalinya\Naku menghadap Anda, Tuan Dias.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.98,0:16:53.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia bisa bicara!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.38,0:16:59.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hamba bernama Geraint,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:59.56,0:17:02.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,burung merpati pembawa pesan intelijen\Nyang mengabdi pada Tuan Eldan,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:03.15,0:17:05.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,sekaligus pemimpin pasukan pengirim surat.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:05.37,0:17:08.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ja-Jadi kau juga seorang Setengah Manusia?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:08.41,0:17:11.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar sekali.\NHamba dari ras Suku Manusia Merpati.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:11.88,0:17:14.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ma-Maafkan kelancanganku kalau begitu.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.21,0:17:16.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tak apa-apa,\Nmohon jangan dimasukkan ke hati.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.39,0:17:21.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kedatangan hamba kali ini untuk menyampaikan\Nsepucuk surat dari Tuan Eldan,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:21.77,0:17:24.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,katanya soal urusan yang sangat mendesak.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.85,0:17:32.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:32.65,0:17:34.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku yang membukanya, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:36.11,0:17:38.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Suku Manusia Anjing ras kecil
Dialogue: 10,0:17:38.16,0:17:41.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,sangat berminat\Npada perekrutan rakyat wilayahmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.51,0:17:44.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mohon pertimbangkan\Napa mereka bisa diterima.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:44.91,0:17:48.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Geraint, apa maksudnya ras kecil?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:48.85,0:17:52.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di Suku Manusia Anjing,\Nada ras besar dan kecil...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.17,0:17:57.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ras besar punya kekuatan kuat\Ndan wujud mendekati manusia.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.58,0:18:01.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sebaliknya, ras kecil wujudnya\Nlebih dekat spesies asli, tenaga lemah,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:01.81,0:18:04.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan karena punya bantalan cakar,\Nmereka kurang cekatan.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:04.31,0:18:06.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:06.05,0:18:10.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka tampaknya dengar cerita dari\Nras besar yang pernah tinggal di Desa Iluk,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:10.06,0:18:13.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,lalu mendambakan kehidupan di sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:13.41,0:18:14.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baiklah.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.19,0:18:18.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau sudah dapat persetujuan warga desa,\Naku akan terima mereka.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.65,0:18:21.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku mau tanya dulu, tolong tunggu di sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:21.61,0:18:23.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hamba mengerti.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:32.51,0:18:34.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau mau, apa kau mau makan kacang itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:34.70,0:18:36.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Boleh?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.59,0:18:38.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.09,0:18:40.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gukguk bakal datang?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:40.31,0:18:41.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Syukurlah, ya!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:41.35,0:18:42.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita bisa main bareng, ya!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:42.98,0:18:45.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak, maksudku ini\Nbelum benar-benar kuputuskan, sih...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.60,0:18:49.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Suasananya sudah tak mendukung\Nuntuk menasihati mereka lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.60,0:18:49.35,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Gukguk!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:49.35,0:18:51.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Alna, bisa bicara sebentar?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:49.35,0:18:51.86,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Asyik, tidak sabar!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:54.15,0:18:56.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa mereka berdua cerita sesuatu padamu?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.36,0:18:58.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:58.11,0:18:59.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka tampaknya memang menyesal,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:59.86,0:19:04.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi bersikeras tak mau kasih tahu alasan\Nkenapa tidur sambil peluk tikus itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:04.37,0:19:07.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pasti ada alasan kuat di balik semua itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:07.35,0:19:10.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mari kita tunggu sampai\Nsuatu hari nanti mereka cerita sendiri.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:10.94,0:19:13.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, baiklah kalau kau bilang begitu, Dias.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:13.88,0:19:17.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Omong-omong, bagaimana\Nsoal penerimaan rakyat wilayah baru?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:17.73,0:19:19.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pertama, aku ingin dengar pendapatmu, Alna.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.88,0:19:22.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lakukan saja sesukamu, Dias.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.81,0:19:25.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tugasku adalah mendukung keputusanmu itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.39,0:19:26.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:26.58,0:19:30.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi kalau ada yang mengganjal,\Nkatakan saja tanpa sungkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.35,0:19:31.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagiku, Alna itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:31.75,0:19:33.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagi Dias,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.15,0:19:37.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku istri yang paling hebat, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:39.75,0:19:43.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tadinya aku berniat bilang\Ndia sosok yang sangat bisa diandalkan,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.38,0:19:46.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi bahkan dalam pengelolaan wilayah pun,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.55,0:19:50.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,begitu juga soal melindungi keluarga...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:52.71,0:19:54.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mohon pertimbangkanlah!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.25,0:19:56.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sungguh ingin tinggal di desa ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:57.16,0:19:58.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:58.38,0:20:03.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi bukankah kalau kau di wilayah Eldan,\Nakhirnya bisa pulang kampung, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.22,0:20:05.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa pilih tempat ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.22,0:20:06.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:06.45,0:20:08.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku cuma mau bantu Senai dan Ayhan
Dialogue: 10,0:20:08.72,0:20:10.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,dari dekat...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:10.55,0:20:14.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah, maksudku,\Nbukan karena tertarik kekuatan mereka,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:14.23,0:20:18.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,walau terlihat begini,\Naku bisa membaca, menulis, dan berhitung.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:18.01,0:20:21.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi aku bisa jadi guru pembimbing\Nuntuk Senai dan Ayhan,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:21.16,0:20:23.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,atau kerjakan apa pun yang bisa kuusahakan.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.95,0:20:26.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena itu,\Nmohon izinkan aku tinggal di sini!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:29.65,0:20:34.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yah, asalkan kau janji\Nselalu jaga kebersihan dan hidup higienis.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:35.79,0:20:37.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mengenai ras kecil itu,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:37.79,0:20:40.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,persetujuan seluruh rakyat wilayah\Nsudah kudapat.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:40.35,0:20:44.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga sudah tulis pesan kami\Nbersedia terima Aymer, kutitip surat ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.38,0:20:47.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hamba laksanakan.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:01.61,0:21:03.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dias, bangun.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.07,0:21:04.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada tamu datang.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:04.91,0:21:07.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tamu? Sepagi ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:07.32,0:21:10.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tadi aku tertidur,\Njadi agak terlambat sadar.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:10.18,0:21:12.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka sudah datang sangat dekat.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:14.83,0:21:17.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kemungkinan besar mereka\NSuku Manusia Anjing yang dibicarakan itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:17.58,0:21:19.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hawa yang jelas terasa ada satu orang,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:19.98,0:21:21.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan beberapa yang bertubuh kecil.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:21.76,0:21:24.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu, ada satu yang ukurannya sangat besar.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:24.47,0:21:27.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau yang jumlahnya banyak\Nmungkin Suku Manusia Anjing,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:27.04,0:21:28.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi yang sangat besar itu apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:28.95,0:21:30.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tak tahu.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:31.22,0:21:32.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa yang itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:42.22,0:21:44.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa yang itu juga manusia hewan\Nyang mau bergabung?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:44.60,0:21:47.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan! Itu Lick Anaconda, seekor monster!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:47.74,0:21:49.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka sedang dikejar!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:50.34,0:21:50.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sialan!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:51.62,0:21:54.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gawat! Busur panahku tertinggal!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:58.36,0:21:59.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada yang dimakan!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:59.60,0:22:00.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tolong!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:00.42,0:22:01.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siapa saja, tolong!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:03.51,0:22:04.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tunggu!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:04.35,0:22:06.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau tak punya senjata!
